# IONMIX4-style multigroup-opacity fixture for the [16a]/#7 unit test.
# Lines beginning with '#' are comments (skipped by the reader). All numeric
# tokens are whitespace-delimited and consumed in order.
#
# Layout:
#   ntemp ndens ngroups
#   temps[ntemp]             (eV, log-spaced ascending)
#   densities[ndens]         (g/cc, log-spaced ascending)
#   group_bounds[ngroups+1]  (eV, ascending photon-energy boundaries)
#   planck_absorb[it][id][ig]  (cm^2/g, group index fastest)
#   planck_emiss [it][id][ig]
#   rosseland    [it][id][ig]
#
# Synthetic positive power-law opacities (exact under log-log interpolation):
#   planck_absorb(ig,rho,T) = 2.0*(ig+1)*rho^0.5*T^-1.5
#   planck_emiss (ig,rho,T) = 3.0*(ig+1)*rho^0.4*T^-1.0
#   rosseland    (ig,rho,T) = 1.5*(ig+1)*rho^0.6*T^-2.0
# with rho in g/cc, T in eV.
#
# header: ntemp ndens ngroups
         5         4         4
# temperature nodes [eV]
 1.0000000000000000e+00 1.0000000000000000e+01 1.0000000000000000e+02 1.0000000000000000e+03
 1.0000000000000000e+04
# density nodes [g/cc]
 1.0000000000000000e-03 1.0000000000000000e-02 1.0000000000000001e-01 1.0000000000000000e+00
# group energy boundaries [eV] (ngroups+1)
 1.0000000000000000e+00 1.0000000000000000e+01 1.0000000000000000e+02 1.0000000000000000e+03
 1.0000000000000000e+04
